Description: Builds the pinned in-tree 'DRAGMAP' hash-table generator and
    short-read aligner with a portable baseline and runtime-gated AVX2 on
    supported x86 processors. Stateless R functions build reference indexes
    and align FASTQ input through one package-owned executable without
    searching 'PATH'. The same source also compiles for AArch64, where 'SIMDe'
    maps the imported 128-bit vector operations to NEON.
